@base = http://localhost:8000/api

### 1. Товар
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"sku":"A-001","name":"Чай","unit":"упак","retail_price":"125.50"}

### 2. Отдел с первой продажей (product_id из ответа шага 1)
POST {{base}}/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"code":"D-01","name":"Бакалея","manager_name":"Иванов Иван Иванович","phone":"+7 4012 00-00-00","daily_plan":"1000.00","initial_sale":{"product_id":1,"sale_date":"2026-05-01","quantity":"2"}}

### 3. Дополнительная продажа
POST {{base}}/sales
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"department_id":1,"product_id":1,"sale_date":"2026-05-01","quantity":"3"}

### 4. Список
GET {{base}}/sales
Accept: application/json

### 5. Изменение количества
PATCH {{base}}/sales/2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"quantity":"4"}

### 6. План: выручка 753.00, выполнение 75.30% после шагов 1–5
GET {{base}}/reports/daily?date=2026-05-01
Accept: application/json

### 7. Спрос: 6 упаковок, 2 записи продаж
GET {{base}}/reports/demand?from=2026-05-01&to=2026-05-31
Accept: application/json

### 8. Удаление второй продажи (204)
DELETE {{base}}/sales/2
Accept: application/json

### 9. Попытка удалить последнюю (409)
DELETE {{base}}/sales/1
Accept: application/json
